{
  "technical_and_design_decisions": [
    "Make the logging directory path in Spring XD configurable via a new environment variable/system property (e.g., `xd.log.dir`), defaulting to `${xd.home}/logs` if not specified.",
    "Extract core message-bus and serialization codec components into a separate `spring-bus` project module and publish as Maven artifacts to allow modular consumption across Spring XD and related subprojects.",
    "Move type conversion infrastructure directly into `spring-cloud-dataflow` to standardize module payload conversion.",
    "Implement the single-node XD Admin SPI using Module Launcher within a single JVM process for local developer stream execution.",
    "Implement the Diego/Receptor SPI by integrating with the Lattice/Diego Receptor REST API to manage module container deployment lifecycles on Cloud Foundry."
  ],
  "assumptions": [
    "Development environment includes access to Teradata instance/emulator and Cloud Foundry Diego/Lattice test cluster for verification.",
    "The target code repositories (`spring-xd`, `spring-bus`, `spring-cloud-dataflow`) are configured with working CI/CD pipelines.",
    "The developer has full access to repository management tools to extract and publish newly created libraries (`spring-bus`).",
    "No major architectural changes to Module Launcher are required beyond standard SPI extensions."
  ],
  "activities": [
    {
      "activity_id": "ACT-1",
      "activity_name": "Resolve Teradata Sqoop Job NPE and Integration",
      "activity_description": "Investigate and resolve the NullPointerException when using standard Teradata JDBC driver in Sqoop batch jobs, and ensure seamless support for Teradata connection manager configuration (U1).",
      "most_likely_effort": 2.0
    },
    {
      "activity_id": "ACT-2",
      "activity_name": "Configurable Spring XD Logging Directory",
      "activity_description": "Modify logging configuration templates (Log4j/Logback) and system property resolution to support custom external log directories such as `/var/logs/spring-xd` (U2).",
      "most_likely_effort": 1.0
    },
    {
      "activity_id": "ACT-3",
      "activity_name": "Extract Message Bus to spring-bus Project",
      "activity_description": "Extract the message-bus core module from Spring XD into a standalone `spring-bus` repository, set up build configurations, and re-integrate into Spring XD as a Maven dependency (U3).",
      "most_likely_effort": 4.0
    },
    {
      "activity_id": "ACT-4",
      "activity_name": "Move Type Conversion to spring-cloud-dataflow",
      "activity_description": "Migrate input/output type conversion capabilities from Spring XD to `spring-cloud-dataflow`, enabling custom domain object serialization and deserialization across streams (U4).",
      "most_likely_effort": 3.0
    },
    {
      "activity_id": "ACT-5",
      "activity_name": "Extract Serialization Codec to spring-bus",
      "activity_description": "Extract serialization codec implementations from Spring XD to `spring-bus` and update dependencies in Spring XD (U5).",
      "most_likely_effort": 2.5
    },
    {
      "activity_id": "ACT-6",
      "activity_name": "Implement Single-Node XD Admin SPI",
      "activity_description": "Develop a single-node (single JVM) implementation of XD Admin SPI leveraging Module Launcher for local execution of data pipeline streams (U6).",
      "most_likely_effort": 5.0
    },
    {
      "activity_id": "ACT-7",
      "activity_name": "Implement Diego Receptor XD Admin SPI",
      "activity_description": "Implement the XD Admin SPI using Diego Receptor client API for deploying and orchestrating Module Launcher instances on Cloud Foundry Lattice/Diego (U7).",
      "most_likely_effort": 7.0
    },
    {
      "activity_id": "ACT-8",
      "activity_name": "Investigate Service Discovery for s-c-s Modules",
      "activity_description": "Conduct technical investigation and build a proof-of-concept for Spring Cloud Stream modules self-registering to service discovery for runtime discovery and orchestration (U8).",
      "most_likely_effort": 3.5
    },
    {
      "activity_id": "ACT-9",
      "activity_name": "Integration Testing and Verification",
      "activity_description": "Perform end-to-end integration testing across migrated components, single-node and Diego SPI implementations, and verify Maven build pipelines.",
      "most_likely_effort": 3.0
    }
  ],
  "reported_total": {
    "most_likely_effort": 31.0
  }
}
```

